<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>About · 3Dfidgets.shop</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.svg">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lilita+One&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Fredoka+One&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root{--yellow:#ffffff;--dark:#1a1a2e}
    *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    body{font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;background:#f5f0eb;color:var(--dark)}
    main{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 1rem}
    h1{font-family:'Lilita One',cursive;font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem}
    .card{background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--dark);border-radius:20px;padding:1.4rem 1.6rem;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--dark)}
    .card p{font-weight:600;color:#444;line-height:1.6}
    .site-footer{position:relative;z-index:5;background:var(--dark);color:var(--yellow);border-top:3px solid var(--yellow);margin-top:2.5rem}
    .footer-inner{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 1.2rem 1.4rem}
    .footer-top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem;align-items:start}
    .footer-brand{font-family:'Lilita One',cursive;font-size:1.6rem;line-height:1;color:#cacaca}
    .footer-tagline{margin-top:.4rem;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);line-height:1.5}
    .footer-title{font-family:'Fredoka One',cursive;font-size:.9rem;letter-spacing:.6px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:.55rem;color:#FF4D8D}
    .footer-links{display:grid;gap:.4rem}
    .footer-link{color:#D48867;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}
    .footer-link:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;color:#563737}
    .footer-bottom{margin-top:1.4rem;padding-top:1rem;border-top:2px dashed rgba(255,217,61,.4);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:.8rem}
    .footer-copy{font-family:'Fredoka One',cursive;font-size:.86rem;letter-spacing:.4px}
    .footer-copy span{color:#FF4D8D}
    .footer-note{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8)}
    @media(max-width:600px){.footer-top{grid-template-columns:1fr}.footer-inner{padding:1.6rem 1rem 1.2rem}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="custom-header">
  <div class="header-content">
    <div class="header-logo">
      <span class="header-logo-icon">🎲</span>
      <div class="header-logo-texts">
        <span class="header-logo-title">3Dfidgets.shop</span>
        <span class="header-logo-sub">3d printed fidgets for all ages</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav class="header-nav">
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class="header-blobs">
    <div class="header-blob header-blob-1"></div>
    <div class="header-blob header-blob-2"></div>
    <div class="header-blob header-blob-3"></div>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
.custom-header{width:100%;min-height:30px;position:relative;background:#FF6B35 url('Endless_Tools_2026-04-22_03-30-42.jpeg') center/cover no-repeat;overflow:hidden;border-bottom:3px #1A1A2E solid;box-sizing:border-box}
.header-content{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;width:100%;position:relative;padding:12px 32px 0 32px;z-index:3;max-height:100px;min-height:100px}
.header-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px}
.header-logo-icon{font-size:2.2rem}
.header-logo-texts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px}
.header-logo-title{color:#ffffff;font-size:2.2rem;font-family:'Lilita One',cursive;font-weight:400;line-height:1.1;text-shadow:0px 2px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.75);letter-spacing:1.5px}
.header-logo-sub{color:#FFF9F0;font-size:0.85rem;font-family:Nunito,sans-serif;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px}
.header-nav{display:flex;gap:16px}
.header-nav a{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#1A1A2E;border-radius:100px;outline:2px #1A1A2E solid;outline-offset:-2px;color:#C7C2BC;font-size:0.95rem;font-family:'Fredoka One',cursive;font-weight:400;width:72px;height:32px;text-decoration:none;transition:background 0.2s,color 0.2s}
.header-nav a:last-child{width:110px;color:#C9C4BE}
.header-nav a:hover{background:#FF4D8D;color:#fff}
.header-blobs{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none;z-index:1}
.header-blob{position:absolute;opacity:0.15;border-radius:50%}
.header-blob-1{width:200px;height:200px;left:-40px;top:-60px;background:#FFD93D}
.header-blob-2{width:140px;height:140px;right:192px;bottom:0;background:#4ECDC4}
.header-blob-3{width:80px;height:80px;right:16px;top:67.59px;background:#fff}
@media(max-width:900px){.header-content{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;padding:24px 16px 0 16px}}
@media(max-width:600px){
  .header-nav a{width:60px;height:28px;font-size:0.8rem}
  .header-nav a:last-child{width:80px}
  .header-blob-1{width:100px;height:100px;left:-20px;top:-30px}
  .header-blob-2{width:70px;height:70px;right:60px;bottom:0}
  .header-blob-3{width:40px;height:40px;right:8px;top:34px}
}
</style>

<main>
  <section class="card">
    <h1>About Us</h1>
    <p>
      We make playful, high-quality 3D printed fidgets in Australia. Every item is designed and printed with care,
      checked for smooth movement, and packed with love for all ages.
    </p>
  </section>
  <br>
  <br>
  <section class="card">
    <h1>Our Prices</h1>
    <p>
      We ensure our prices are fair and reflect the quality of our products. Each fidget is priced below our competitors to ensure that you get the same quality at a better price. Each fidget is made to order using premium materials.
    </p>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-top">
      <div>
        <div class="footer-brand">3Dfidgets.shop</div>
        <p class="footer-tagline">Premium 3D printed fidgets made in Australia for play, focus, and everyday fun.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="footer-title">Quick Links</div>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a class="footer-link" href="index.html">Shop</a>
          <a class="footer-link" href="about.html">About</a>
          <a class="footer-link" href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
          <a class="footer-link" href="returns.html">Returns</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="footer-title">Support</div>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a class="footer-link" href="contact.html">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <div class="footer-copy">Made with <span>♥</span> &amp; filament · Payments secured by Stripe 🔒</div>
      <div class="footer-note">© 2026 3Dfidgets.shop · Australia Wide</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>